No third-party artwork is distributed with this project.

The default animation is Twitch's DinoDance emote, loaded at runtime from
Twitch's own CDN and never copied into this repository. It remains the property
of Twitch Interactive, Inc.

Tempo detection is provided by libsonare (Apache-2.0), likewise loaded from a
CDN at runtime rather than redistributed here.
